{"id":"vod_sn_37983","vodId":"37983","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"兽王星","name_cn":"兽王星","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ece25dcd64c5384027c883d22ca48497.jpg"},"summary":"因为双亲被杀，特尔（堂本光一 配音）和弟弟莱伊（高山南 配音）被放逐到了危险的兽王星上，这是一个被女性统治的星球。在这里，居民按肤色被分为“茶”“白”“黄”“黑”四“轮”，而每轮都有三位领袖人物，战争在这四轮之间不断的上演。在逃亡的过程中，特尔与莱伊失散了，同时，特尔也得知了父母遇害的真相。得知莱伊已死的特尔悲愤交加，他决定坚强的生存下去，为弟弟和父母报仇。　　在茶轮的首领挑战赛中，特尔获得了胜利成为了茶轮的首领。而他的目的并不止于此，他希望成为的，是兽王星真正的、唯一的统治者。在萨德（小栗旬 配音）的帮助下，特尔一路过关斩将，而当他踏上最后的战场时，出现在他面前的对手，竟然是莱伊。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/stE2S147GJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qXJB8HyCqv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/18TUcPgfSG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tSRf9hnJHJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qwy4RNSCtA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WruuSYpC4P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XupgTBayxA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rmVTZ4i0yH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/smmUkPYuwU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vHEjFQhjJ91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DQ7vNkL9v81/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:04.326Z"}